00002000                      00003000             153          USING  BEGIN+4096,R9      SECOND Base Register
00002000                      00004000             154          USING  BEGIN+8192,R10     THIRD Base Register

00002000  0580                                     156 BEGIN    BALR  R8,0                Initalize FIRST base register
