                                                   444 ***********************************************************************
                                                   445 *        Issue HERCULES MESSAGE
                                                   446 *              R0 = length of message
                                                   447 *              R1 = message address
                                                   448 *              R2 = return address
                                                   449 ***********************************************************************

00002598  4900 8688                     00002688   451 MSG      CH    R0,=H'0'            Do we even HAVE a message?
0000259C  07D2                                     452          BNHR  R2                  No, ignore

