000025A2  4900 868A                     0000268A   456          CH    R0,=AL2(L'MSGMSG)   Message length within limits?
000025A6  47D0 85AE                     000025AE   457          BNH   MSGOK               Yes, continue
000025AA  4100 005F                     0000005F   458          LA    R0,L'MSGMSG         No, set to maximum

