                                                   727 ***********************************************************************
                                                   728 *     Macros to help build test tables
                                                   729 ***********************************************************************



                                                   731 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   732 * TSTPLO : test whether a PLO function is available/installed.
                                                   733 *          If a functionm is installed, CC=0. Not installed, CC=3.
                                                   734 *          - &fun: the function number
                                                   735 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   736          MACRO
                                                   737          TSTPLO  &FUN
                                                   738          GBLA  &TNUM
                                                   739 &TNUM    SETA  &TNUM+1
                                                   740 *
                                                   741 * test if PLO function is available
                                                   742 *
                                                   743          USING *,R5                base for test data and test routine
                                                   744          USING PLOAVAL,R5
                                                   745
                                                   746 T&TNUM   DC    A(CODE&TNUM)           address of test routine
                                                   747          DC    H'&TNUM'            test number
                                                   748          DC    X'00'
                                                   749          DC    HL1'&FUN'           Function Number
                                                   750 *
                                                   751 CODE&TNUM DS    0F
                                                   752          LA    R1,(256+&FUN)       T bit 55  (+256)
                                                   753          LR    R0,R1
                                                   754          PLO   0,0,0,0
                                                   755          BZ    0(R11)              Function is installed, return
                                                   756
                                                   757          BAL   R15,NAMSG           Function not available message
                                                   758          BR    R11                 return
                                                   759          DROP  R5
                                                   760 *
                                                   761          MEND
                                                   762
                                                   763 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   764 * TSTLBL : insert a label with a test number suffix
                                                   765 *          - &name: the label name
                                                   766 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   767          MACRO
                                                   768          TSTLBL  &NAME
                                                   769          GBLA  &TNUM
                                                   770          LCLC  &X
                                                   771 &X       SETC  '&NAME&TNUM'
                                                   772          DC    CL32'>>>&X<<<'      eye catcher
                                                   773 &X       DS  0C
                                                   774          MEND
