                                                   776 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   777 * TSTEND : end a test
                                                   778 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   779          MACRO
                                                   780          TSTEND  &NAME
                                                   781          GBLA  &TNUM
                                                   782          DC    CL32'END of test: &TNUM <<<'
                                                   783          MEND
                                                   784
                                                   785 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   786 * TSTCODE : The code for the test follows the label
                                                   787 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   788          MACRO
                                                   789          TSTCODE  &NAME
                                                   790          GBLA  &TNUM
                                                   791          LCLC  &X
                                                   792 &X       SETC  'CODE&TNUM'
                                                   793 &X       DS    0F
                                                   794          MEND
                                                   795
                                                   796 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   797 * TSTDATA: The data for the test follows.
                                                   798 *          Data is aligned to the 1.5K boundary after the TSTHDR
                                                   799 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   800          MACRO
                                                   801          TSTDATA  &NAME
                                                   802          GBLA  &THDRNUM
                                                   803          ORG   PLOETST+(128*K)+&THDRNUM*(3*K)+(K+512)
                                                   804          MEND
