                                                   806 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   807 * TSTHDR: The start of a PLOE function test
                                                   808 *         Test is aligned to 3K boundary starting at 128K
                                                   809 *              (1.5K data/code; 1.5K instruction test data)
                                                   810 *
                                                   811 *        Note: PLOETEST DSECT needs to be in-sync with TSTHDR
                                                   812 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   813          MACRO
                                                   814          TSTHDR  &CC,&UR,&FUN
                                                   815 .*                      &CC    - expected CC
                                                   816 .*                      &UR    - expected unequal results
                                                   817 .*                      &FUN   - function
                                                   818
                                                   819          LCLA  &XCC(4)  &CC has mask values for FAILED condition codes
                                                   820 &XCC(1)  SETA  7                   CC != 0
                                                   821 &XCC(2)  SETA  11                  CC != 1
                                                   822 &XCC(3)  SETA  13                  CC != 2
                                                   823 &XCC(4)  SETA  14                  CC != 3
                                                   824
                                                   825          GBLA  &TNUM
                                                   826 &TNUM    SETA  &TNUM+1
                                                   827
                                                   828          GBLA  &THDRNUM
                                                   829 &THDRNUM SETA  &THDRNUM+1
                                                   830
                                                   831          ORG   PLOETST+(128*K)+&THDRNUM*(3*K)
                                                   832          DC    CL32'START of test: &TNUM'
                                                   833
                                                   834          USING *,R5                base for test data and test routine
                                                   835          USING PLOETEST,R5
                                                   836
                                                   837 T&TNUM   DC    A(CODE&TNUM)        address of test code
                                                   838          DC    H'&TNUM'            test number
                                                   839          DC    X'00'
                                                   840          DC    HL1'&FUN'           Function
                                                   841          DC    HL1'&UR'            expected unequal results (UR)
                                                   842          DC    HL1'00'             found UR
                                                   843
                                                   844          DC    HL1'&CC'            cc
                                                   845          AIF   ('&CC' EQ '99').NOCC
                                                   846          DC    HL1'&XCC(&CC+1)'    not expected CC mask
                                                   847          AGO   .CCCONT
                                                   848 .NOCC    ANOP
                                                   849          DC    HL1'00'             cc not checked
                                                   850 .CCCONT  ANOP
                                                   851
                                                   852          DS    X                   extracted cc
                                                   853          DS    2F                  extract PSW after test (has CC)
                                                   854          DC    A(FMSG&TNUM)        address of test fail message
                                                   855          DC    A(OPSRC&TNUM)       address of operand source
                                                   856          DC    A(OPDST&TNUM)       address of operand destination
                                                   857          DC    A(PL&TNUM)          address of parameter list
                                                   858          DC    A(RANDX+&TNUM)      address of random source data
                                                   859 .*
                                                   860          MEND
